course: dictionary
lesson: 14570
title: Pillowcase
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A pillowcase is a cloth cover for your pillow. Its name gives a clue: a pillow goes inside it, like a case. «Mum put a clean pillowcase on my pillow.» Here the pillowcase is the cover that goes over the pillow to keep it clean.
explain: Because a pillowcase is a cover, it can come off. «Every Sunday I take my pillowcase off and put it in the wash.» So you know it can be taken off and washed, and a clean one can go on again.
explain: Use the words around a word to help you. Words like «clean», «wash» and «change» tell you a pillowcase is something you swap and wash. To check, put the word «cover» in its place. If the sentence still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
fact: A pillowcase is a cloth cover that goes over a pillow.
fact: A pillowcase keeps the pillow clean.
fact: You can take a pillowcase off and wash it.
fact: «Change the pillowcase» means put a clean one on the pillow.
fact: Children sometimes use a pillowcase as a bag, for example to carry sweets at Halloween or in a pillowcase race.
exercise: What is a pillowcase? | A pillow with a zip | *A cloth cover that goes over a pillow | A blanket for your feet | A hard shell that goes under your bed
exercise: Why do we wash a pillowcase? | To make it heavier | To hide it under the bed | *To keep it clean | To change its colour for ever
exercise: «Mum put a clean pillowcase on my bed.» Find and copy one word that names the cover for a pillow. | clean | bed | *pillowcase | Mum
test: Which can you take off and wash? | A pillow | A bed frame | *A pillowcase
test: What does «change the pillowcase» mean? | Put the pillow on the floor | Eat the pillow | *Swap a dirty cover for a clean one
exam: Which is the best way to keep a pillow clean? | Sleep on the floor | Hide the pillow in a box | *Put a clean pillowcase over it and wash the pillowcase often
